      "message": "It felt a bit odd to define an interface in src/text/gpu that explicitly returned a graphite type (Renderer). The vision I had was that both Ganesh and Graphite would have a provider that implements the same common interface (Renderers), which means the type they return cannot be backend specific.\n\nIf we think it would be better to forward declare the Graphite Renderer type and have the interface have two sets of functions, one for Ganesh and one for Graphite, we can do that (and remove the void* and the cast). \n\nThe one use of this return value is in src/gpu/graphite/Device.cpp (see this same CL).",
